#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:4
msgid "Возможности интеграции с DaData"
msgstr "DaData Integration Capabilities"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:6
msgid ""
"`DaData <https://dadata.ru/>`__ — сервис подсказок и стандартизации "
"данных. Он отдаёт по API сведения об организациях и ИП из ЕГРЮЛ и ЕГРИП, "
"адреса с кодами ФИАС (ГАР) и КЛАДР, реквизиты банков и государственные "
"справочники."
msgstr ""
"`DaData <https://dadata.ru/>`__ is a data suggestion and standardization "
"service. Via API, it provides information about organizations and "
"individual entrepreneurs from the EGRUL and EGRIP (Russian state "
"registers of legal entities and individual entrepreneurs), addresses with "
"FIAS (GAR) and KLADR codes, bank details, and government reference books."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:8
msgid ""
"В Citeck DaData используется для автозаполнения карточки контрагента по "
"ИНН."
msgstr ""
"In Citeck, DaData is used to autofill the counterparty card by INN "
"(taxpayer identification number)."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:12
msgid "Доступно только в Enterprise версии."
msgstr "Available only in the Enterprise edition."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Клиент 360<client_360>` — карточка контрагента и экспресс-отчёт "
"Контур.Фокуса."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Client 360<client_360>` — the counterparty card and the "
"Kontur.Focus express report."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:17
msgid ":ref:`dadata_settings` — подключение DaData для администраторов."
msgstr ":ref:`dadata_settings` — connecting DaData, for administrators."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:24
msgid "Автозаполнение контрагента по ИНН"
msgstr "Autofilling a Counterparty by INN"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:26
msgid ""
"При создании карточки контрагента заполните **ИНН** и нажмите "
"**«Автозаполнение»**:"
msgstr ""
"When creating a counterparty card, fill in the **INN** field and click "
"**Autofill**:"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:43
msgid ""
"Citeck отправляет в DaData один запрос и подставляет реквизиты из ЕГРЮЛ в"
" поля карточки. Если часть полей уже заполнена, Citeck спрашивает, "
"перезаписать ли их."
msgstr ""
"Citeck sends a single request to DaData and fills the card fields with "
"details from the EGRUL. If some fields are already filled in, Citeck asks "
"whether to overwrite them."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:45
msgid "Автозаполнение работает на любом тарифе DaData, включая бесплатный."
msgstr "Autofill works on any DaData plan, including the free one."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:48
msgid "Какие поля заполняются"
msgstr "Fields that are filled in"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:55
msgid "Поле карточки"
msgstr "Card field"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:56
msgid "Данные DaData"
msgstr "DaData data"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:57
msgid "Комментарий"
msgstr "Comment"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:58
msgid "Полное наименование"
msgstr "Full name"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:59
msgid "Полное наименование с ОПФ"
msgstr "Full name with legal form"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:61
msgid "Краткое наименование"
msgstr "Short name"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:62
msgid "Краткое наименование с ОПФ"
msgstr "Short name with legal form"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:64 ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:65
msgid "КПП"
msgstr "KPP"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:66
msgid "У ИП КПП нет, поле остаётся пустым"
msgstr "Individual entrepreneurs have no KPP, so the field stays empty"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:67 ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:68
msgid "ОГРН"
msgstr "OGRN"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:69
msgid "У ИП в это поле попадает ОГРНИП"
msgstr "For individual entrepreneurs, this field receives the OGRNIP"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:70 ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:71
msgid "ОКПО"
msgstr "OKPO"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:72
msgid "Есть только у действующих головных организаций и ИП"
msgstr ""
"Available only for active head organizations and individual "
"entrepreneurs"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:73
msgid "Юридический адрес"
msgstr "Legal address"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:74
msgid ""
"Адрес из ЕГРЮЛ по частям: регион, район, город, населённый пункт, улица, "
"дом, корпус, квартира"
msgstr ""
"Address from the EGRUL broken into parts: region, district, city, "
"locality, street, house, building, apartment"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:75
msgid "Строка собирается в Citeck из частей адреса"
msgstr "Citeck assembles the string from the address parts"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:77
msgid "Остальные поля, в том числе руководитель и почтовый адрес, не заполняются."
msgstr ""
"Other fields, including the head and the postal address, are not filled "
"in."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:80
msgid "Сообщения об ошибках"
msgstr "Error messages"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:87
msgid "Сообщение"
msgstr "Message"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:88
msgid "Когда появляется"
msgstr "When it appears"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:89
msgid "Что сделать"
msgstr "What to do"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:90
msgid "**«Data is empty»**"
msgstr "**\"Data is empty\"**"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:91
msgid "DaData не нашла организацию с таким ИНН"
msgstr "DaData did not find an organization with this INN"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:92
msgid "Проверьте ИНН: у организации 10 цифр, у ИП — 12"
msgstr ""
"Check the INN: an organization's INN has 10 digits, an individual "
"entrepreneur's INN has 12"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:93
msgid "**«Error while requesting data»**"
msgstr "**\"Error while requesting data\"**"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:94
msgid ""
"Запрос к DaData завершился ошибкой, например исчерпан суточный лимит "
"запросов"
msgstr ""
"The request to DaData failed, for example, because the daily request "
"limit has been reached"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:95
msgid ""
"Обратитесь к администратору. Причины ошибок описаны в разделе "
":ref:`dadata_settings`"
msgstr ""
"Contact your administrator. The causes of errors are described in "
":ref:`dadata_settings`"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:98
msgid "Тарифы DaData"
msgstr "DaData Plans"

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:100
msgid ""
"Суточный лимит общий на все сервисы подписки: подсказки, поиск "
"организаций, банков и адресов, справочники. Подписка оформляется минимум "
"на год; при переходе на старший тариф из цены нового вычитается "
"остаточная стоимость текущего."
msgstr ""
"The daily limit is shared by all subscription services: suggestions, "
"search for organizations, banks and addresses, and reference books. The "
"subscription is purchased for at least one year; when upgrading to a "
"higher plan, the remaining value of the current plan is deducted from "
"the price of the new one."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:102
msgid ""
"Актуальные цены и лимиты представлены на странице `тарифов DaData "
"<https://dadata.ru/pricing/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Current prices and limits are listed on the `DaData pricing page "
"<https://dadata.ru/pricing/>`_."

#: ../../introduction/dadata_info.rst:104
msgid ""
"Какие ещё возможности DaData можно подключить к Citeck — в разделе "
":ref:`dadata_capabilities`."
msgstr ""
"For other DaData capabilities that can be connected to Citeck, see "
":ref:`dadata_capabilities`."
